Tests pass. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector.go`** — added the `Len` method (between `WithStack` and the previous `WithStack`):

```go
// Len returns the number of AST nodes in the files supplied to [New],
// the same count that [go/ast.Inspect] visits over those files.
func (in *Inspector) Len() int {
	n := 0
	for i := range in.events {
		if in.events[i].index > int32(i) {
			n++
		}
	}
	return n
}
```

It counts push events (where `index > i`), which equals the total number of AST nodes since each node produces exactly one push and one pop event.

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector_test.go`** — added a `Len` assertion inside `TestInspectAllNodes` that counts nodes via `ast.Inspect` and verifies `inspect.Len()` matches.

